Step 1: Revert commit 3a708b5 on dev branch.
git revert 3a708b5 --no-edit

Step 2: Verify --border-hover and --border-active are back to original values
(--border-hover: #333333, --border-active: #3D3D3D). These are GLOBAL tokens
and must not be modified.

Step 3: ADD new input-specific tokens to design/tokens.css after the "Borders" section:

  /* ───── Inputs ───── */
  --input-bg:            #242424;
  --input-bg-focus:      #2A2A2A;
  --input-bg-disabled:   #1E1E1E;
  --input-border:        #2A2A2A;
  --input-border-hover:  #333333;
  --input-border-focus:  #3B82F6;
  --input-border-error:  #EF4444;
  --input-glow-focus:    rgba(59,130,246,0.13);
  --input-glow-error:    rgba(239,68,68,0.13);

Step 4: ADD an "### Inputs" section to design/[design.md](http://design.md) after "Borders" and
before "Accent (blue)". Document the states table with the values above
(Default #2A2A2A, Hover #333333, Focus #3B82F6 + 3px glow, Error #EF4444 + 3px glow).

Single commit on dev. Message: "design: add input-specific tokens and states"
Don't push.
